<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\The_Covert.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>We finished breakfast too and headed to the room on the second floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s attitude earlier had frozen the air between the two of us as well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I know, I know. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> acted like that because she's serious. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So I'm not gonna snap at </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> anymore."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What kind of face is <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> making on the other side of this sliding door?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she still has that sharp glare from before, it'll be hard to talk.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Phew..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put my hand on the sliding door and took a deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"You nervous?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　It's fine, I'm telling you. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s not that clueless, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神全身.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the room stood a tiny person wearing a Noh mask and robes.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神威圧.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Boooo!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hey, hey, look! With this, do I look intimidating too!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s tone of voice was back to its usual rowdy self.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, no... just what you did earlier was intimidating enough...<PG>
Still, there was something off about this getup of <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her body was too small, so the Noh mask and robes were out of proportion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've seen this sight somewhere before...<PG>
Ah! I remember!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\アリクイ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Exactly like the threat pose of the lesser anteater I saw at some zoo a long time ago!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The way it stood up spread-eagled and threatened with everything it had.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was so cute...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... so cute..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Pfft-hahahahahaha! What's with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! You're a big-headed monster that'd show up in a kids' anime!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神怒るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-what kind of way to put it is that!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神威圧バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Look, look, rawr!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>... that's so calculated...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, she isn't even aware of it, so she's just plain cute...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, that really doesn't suit </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Here, how about this? Not a young woman's mask, a hannya mask!" [TN: A hannya is the Noh mask of a horned demon-woman.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh! I've always wanted to try one on!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{MOTION "789" "人物1" "3" "750" "500" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> eagerly swapped her Noh mask for the hannya.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島般若威圧バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MOTION "789" "人物1" "3" "371" "500" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ta-da! How's this!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> spread her arms wide and struck an even more intimidating pose―
{PAUSE ""}
or so she must have meant to...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Pfft!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a kindergarten play.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wh-why are you laughing!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahaha! That's great, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! You're prettier than usual with that hannya on!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島般若怒るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Gyaah! Are you saying my looks score is below a hannya's!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"There, there, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're cute!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gave <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> a <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="な">pat</STYLE> on the head, like soothing a little kid.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島般若バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hnn... when </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> does that, I'm helpless..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"There, there, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're cute!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> gave <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> a <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="な">pat</STYLE> on the head the same way.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島般若怒るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> saying it? Frankly, that really ticks me off!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahhahahaha! Good, good, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Go with that hannya!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No! I'm switching to the young woman's mask!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> switched her mask back to the original young woman's mask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But this one looked even more out of proportion.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do that pose from before one more time!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? The threat pose?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神威圧バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Rawr!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay, we've gotta get changed too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"H-hey! Don't ask me to do it and then ignore me!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Also, take your socks off. At the memorial service, you've gotta make sure nobody can tell who you are. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I've got wooden sandals ready for everyone at the front door."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is it because even socks and shoes can give away who someone is?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They're really thorough...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how long are you gonna hold that pose?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Geez! I haaate you both!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―We finished getting ready and left the Niimura house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The meeting hall was supposedly about a 5-minute walk from here, but in the unfamiliar wooden sandals I was a little unsteady.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
On the way, I felt a little wind.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\桜の枝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
But the cherry branch in my hand gave no answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At this point it was a question of the premise itself, but did the curse-killings even really exist?
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\共有殺人.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To us, it was all just stories we had heard. We had never actually experienced the curse-killings.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are there any other rules for the memorial service?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's see... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Probably not to talk with people more than you need to. The shinigami would catch on. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Other than that, just copy what everyone does. Basically you just sit there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The shinigami would catch on?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, here they call dead people shinigami. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You know how they say ghosts try to take living people away with them?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　It's kinda like that. We dress like this so the shinigami can't single out the people they wanna take, or so they say."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"But then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s obviously recognizable... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Even if everyone were dressed the same, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is the one I'm absolutely sure I could pick out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, you don't see many shinigami this out of proportion."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then the shinigami might take me away..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Nah, I don't think they'd take a weirdo like you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神威圧バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Grrr!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Geez, she's so cute!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\五島死神バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Come to think of it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, if you're holding the cherry branch, people'll know it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Oh, you're right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> told me to bring it, so that's safe, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well, still, only the Niimuras and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> know you've got the branch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So, there's a decent wind. Don't you feel anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No... nothing..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
