<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe the accomplice caused a curse-killing during the watch to prove </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wasn't the culprit?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see, that seems quite possible too. </STYLE>
