For all the guesses flying around, we were only walking circles around the truth, with no sign of getting any closer.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, did you figure anything out from what </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said earlier?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There wasn't anything that looked like a real lie, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
