{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. Even if people suspected </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I think it was in a more </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="えんきょく">roundabout</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, softer way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Well, yeah, that figures... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
