<STYLE ID="1">There's also the possibility it was one huge prank by the whole settlement."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, wait, no way. I mean, this settlement's population is under 20 people, right? 10 years ago there had to be at least 30. </STYLE>
